Startup Landing Page – Concept Application (Web Designing Framework)

1. How Bootstrap’s Grid System Helps Build Layouts Faster Compared to Plain CSS
Bootstrap provides a 12-column responsive grid system that makes webpage layout creation fast and organized. Instead of manually writing large amounts of CSS for alignment, spacing, and responsiveness, developers can directly use predefined classes such as container, row, and col.
Example:
<div class="container">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">Left Section</div>
    <div class="col-md-6">Right Section</div>
  </div>
</div>
Advantages over Plain CSS:
•	No need to write custom float or flexbox code repeatedly. 
•	Faster page structuring. 
•	Automatic responsive behaviour. 
•	Consistent spacing and alignment. 
•	Easier maintenance and readability. 
Thus, Bootstrap reduces development effort and speeds up the creation of professional startup landing pages.
