2. How Bootstrap Components Like Navbar and Cards Reduce Development Time While Maintaining Consistency
Bootstrap includes ready-made UI components such as:
•	Navbar 
•	Cards 
•	Buttons 
•	Forms 
•	Modals 
•	Alerts 
These components already contain predefined styling and responsive behaviour.
Example:
A navbar can be created with only a few classes:
<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark">
Benefits:
•	Saves time because developers do not design components from scratch. 
•	Ensures uniform appearance across the website. 
•	Components are mobile-friendly by default. 
•	Reduces chances of UI inconsistencies. 
•	Improves user experience with professional design patterns. 
For startups needing quick deployment, Bootstrap components are highly efficient.
