6. How This Page Can Later Be Converted into a React or Angular UI
Bootstrap is compatible with modern frontend frameworks like:
•	React 
•	Angular 
The landing page structure can easily be converted into reusable components.
In React:
•	Navbar becomes a component. 
•	Cards become reusable JSX components. 
•	Forms use state management. 
Example:
function Navbar() {
  return <nav className="navbar navbar-dark bg-dark">Startup</nav>;
}
In Angular:
•	Components and templates are separated. 
•	Bootstrap classes can be directly used inside Angular templates. 
Benefits of Conversion:
•	Better scalability. 
•	Reusable UI components. 
•	Easier state management. 
•	Faster updates and maintenance. 
•	Suitable for large startup applications. 
Therefore, Bootstrap acts as a strong foundation for future frontend framework integration.

